## GitHub App access

Use `gh` and HTTPS Git with the default `GH_TOKEN` for {{.Repo}}. The app can
push feature branches and comment on pull requests in that repository.
For reads in other private repositories covered by the app, use
`GH_TOKEN="$GH_READ_TOKEN" gh …` or `GH_TOKEN="$GH_READ_TOKEN" git …`.
{{else if eq .Mode "read-only" -}}
<!-- opencode-sandbox:github -->

## GitHub App access

Use `gh` or HTTPS Git with `GH_TOKEN` to read repositories covered by the app.
Work locally if you need to make changes; pushes and PR comments are unavailable
in this session.
